<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stroop-test</title>
    <script src="https://jsdelivr.net"></script>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: #0f172a;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            max-width: 660px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0 0 12px 0; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 12px 0; }
        p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; }
        
        .id-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #eff6ff;
            border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
            color: #1d4ed8;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 12px 0 20px 0;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.15s;
        }
        .btn:hover { background-color: #1d4ed8; }

        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 8px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 99px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: #2563eb;
            width: 100%;
            transition: width 1s linear;
        }

        .timer-text {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .stimulus-box {
            height: 130px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .stimulus-word {
            font-size: 4.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .grid-buttons {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .color-btn {
            padding: 18px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #0f172a;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.08s;
        }
        .color-btn:hover { background: #f8fafc; border-color: #94a3b8; }
        .color-btn:active { transform: scale(0.97); }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        th { background-color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600; }

        .stroop-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-top: 18px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .status-msg {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        .hidden { display: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <!-- 1. START SCREEN -->
    <div id="screen-start">
        <h1>Stroop-test (6 delar)</h1>
        <p>Testet tar cirka 4–5 minuter totalt och består av 6 korta delar på 30 sekunder vardera. Läs instruktionerna noga inför varje del.</p>
        <div>Ditt unika anonyma deltagar-ID:</div>
        <div class="id-pill" id="start-id-display"></div>
        <br>
        <button class="btn" onclick="goToInstructions()">Starta testet</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. INSTRUCTION SCREEN -->
    <div id="screen-instructions" class="hidden">
        <h2 id="inst-header"></h2>
        <p id="inst-body" style="margin: 24px 0;"></p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="startTrialSection()">Jag har läst instruktionerna – Starta</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. GAMEPLAY SCREEN -->
    <div id="screen-game" class="hidden">
        <div class="timer-text"><span id="section-label"></span> • Tid kvar: <span id="timer-seconds">30</span>s</div>
        <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div></div>
        
        <div class="stimulus-box">
            <div class="stimulus-word" id="stimulus-word">ORD</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-buttons">
            <button class="color-btn" onclick="submitAnswer('RÖD')">RÖD</button>
            <button class="color-btn" onclick="submitAnswer('BLÅ')">BLÅ</button>
            <button class="color-btn" onclick="submitAnswer('GRÖN')">GRÖN</button>
            <button class="color-btn" onclick="submitAnswer('GUL')">GUL</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. END / RESULTS SCREEN -->
    <div id="screen-end" class="hidden">
        <h2>Testet är slutfört!</h2>
        <p>Deltagar-ID: <strong id="end-id-display"></strong></p>
        <div id="db-status" class="status-msg">Sparar dina resultat...</div>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Del</th>
                    <th>Typ</th>
                    <th>Svarade</th>
                    <th>Rätt</th>
                    <th>Fel</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="results-tbody"></tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="stroop-card" id="stroop-results-box"></div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
